  "result": "Perfect! Here's a summary of what was added:\n\n## Summary\n\nExtended `src/reports.js` with the `vatSummary()` function that:\n\n- **Filters** invoices with status `'issued'`, `'partially_paid'`, or `'paid'`\n- **Calculates** VAT amounts for each line by:\n  - Computing line base: quantity \u00d7 unitPrice - discount\n  - Computing line VAT: roundCents(base \u00d7 vatRate / 100)\n- **Groups** by VAT rate and aggregates base and VAT amounts\n- **Returns** an array of `{ rate, base, vat }` objects sorted by rate descending (high to low)\n\nAdded 26 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Edge cases (empty arrays, excluded statuses)\n- Status filtering (draft, issued, partially_paid, paid)\n- Multiple VAT rates (0%, 9%, 21%)\n- Discount handling (tier discounts, explicit discounts, 100% discount)\n- Aggregation across multiple lines and invoices\n- Correct rounding of VAT amounts\n- Voucher and payment independence (don't affect VAT)\n- Data type and shape validation\n\n**Test results:** All 277 tests pass (214 original + 37 overdueInvoices + 26 vatSummary).",
